# Data-driven integration test for hackathon/house_move, run by tests/integration/test_house_move_hocons.py.
# Format: https://github.com/cognizant-ai-lab/neuro-san/blob/main/docs/test_case_hocon_reference.md
#
# Discovery accuracy for C-20003 (Cardiff to Edinburgh, no TV licence). Ground truth, from the customer's synthetic
# transactions in coded_tools/hackathon/house_move/data/transactions.json:
# - providers: Northgate Energy, Taff Valley Water, Lumen Fibre, Cardiff council tax, DVLA vehicle tax, Shieldmotor
#   Insurance (car) and Hearthguard Home Insurance. Streaming only: no TV Licensing payment. Taff BS is their own
#   mortgage.
# - life facts: a car (vehicle tax, car insurance); no pet and no child.
#
# Providers are checked by keyword where the LLM writes the name consistently, and by `gist` where it may change the
# capitalization (ShieldMotor, VoxMobile); inferred facts and anything worded freely are checked by `gist`.
# The test module issues a fresh session for C-20003 into HOUSE_MOVE_TEST_SESSION_C_20003.
{
    "agent": "hackathon/house_move",
    "timeout_in_seconds": 300,
    "success_ratio": "1/1",
    "connections": ["direct"],
    "interactions": [
        {
            "text": "I'm moving house",
            "sly_data": {"session_token": ${HOUSE_MOVE_TEST_SESSION_C_20003}},
            "response": {
                "text": {
                    "keywords": ["Northgate", "Taff Valley", "Lumen", "DVLA"],
                    "gist": [
                        """The reply names the providers Shieldmotor and Hearthguard among the organizations found.
Capitalization and the words after the brand (for example Insurance, Policy or Mobile) do not matter.""",
                        """The reply lists council tax (Cardiff council, or council tax in general) among the
organizations the customer pays.""",
                        """The reply says the customer has, or probably has, a car or other vehicle (for example from
vehicle tax or car insurance).""",
                        """The reply does not say that a TV Licensing payment was found. Asking whether they have a TV
licence is allowed.""",
                    ]
                }
            }
        },
    ]
}
